# Claude Code rewrites ~/.claude/settings.json in place (atomic rename) on every
# GUI/config change, which destroys any stow symlink and silently leaves the repo
# copy stale. So we do NOT symlink it — it is bootstrap-copied by _install/claude.sh
# and synced back with `just claude-sync`. See AGENTS.md.
settings\.json

# Docs (local ignore overrides the global one, so re-list essentials)
^/README.*
AGENTS\.md
